/*
 * Implements semantic validation for slice-based `for` loops in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Validate iteration over slices.
 *   - Support both element-only and element+index iteration forms.
 *   - Create and manage iterator variables for element and index.
 *   - Construct loop control expressions: test, increment, and body.
 *   - Track reference and alias usage across the loop.
 *   - Manage loop and block scopes, including error aggregation.
 *
 * This module is invoked when the left operand of a `for` loop is a slice.

 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::control::for_::slice
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/control/for_/slice.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-14
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
